          <table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="12" table:style-name="Section"><text:p>특별시장 · 광역시장 · 특별자치시장 · 특별자치도지사 · 도지사 또는 시장 · 군수 · 구청장 귀하</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
